echRecognizer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" does when it is configured for on-device operation. This transcriber does not support languages or locales that ","type":"text"},{"code":"SFSpeechRecognizer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only supports via network access.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Several transcriber instances can share the same backing engine instances and models, so long as the transcribers are configured similarly in certain respects.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Improve-accuracy","level":3,"text":"Improve accuracy","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can bias recognition towards certain words, supply custom vocabulary, or adjust the transcriber’s algorithm to improve the transcriber’s accuracy.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To bias recognition towards certain words, create an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.speech\/documentation\/Speech\/AnalysisContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object and add those words to its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.speech\/documentation\/Speech\/AnalysisContext\/contextualStrings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" property. Create a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.speech\/documentation\/Speech\/SpeechAnalyzer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instance with that context object or set the analyzer’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.speech\/documentation\/Speech\/SpeechAnalyzer\/context","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To supply custom vocabulary, create an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.speech\/documentation\/Speech\/SFSpeechLanguageModel","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object and configure the transcriber with a corresponding ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.ap